{"id":"bd554d3da5a43116","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zeta-function.md","title":"Riemann Zeta Function","display":"df-zeta-function — Riemann Zeta Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zeta-function","aliases":["58-df-zeta-function","Riemann Zeta Function"],"display":"df-zeta-function — Riemann Zeta Function","depends_on":["[[58-df-dirichlet-series]]","[[58-df-holomorphic-function]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zeta-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zeta-function</span><span>Riemann Zeta Function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zeta-function — Riemann Zeta Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d60e86f21ed502a\" href=\"?note=5d60e86f21ed502a\" title=\"58-df-dirichlet-series\">58-df-dirichlet-series</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d85f24c98c7d4149\" href=\"?note=d85f24c98c7d4149\" title=\"58-df-holomorphic-function\">58-df-holomorphic-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\zeta:\\mathbb C\\to\\mathbb C\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\">\\(\\zeta:\\mathbb C\\to\\mathbb C\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HolomorphicFunction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HolomorphicFunction}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d85f24c98c7d4149\" href=\"?note=d85f24c98c7d4149\" title=\"58-df-holomorphic-function\">58-df-holomorphic-function</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeromorphicOn}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MeromorphicOn}_S\\)</span> (meromorphicity predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZetaFunction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZetaFunction}_S\\)</span> (Riemann-zeta predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zeta\\text{-}meromorphic}\\vdash \\mathrm{MeromorphicOn}_S(f,D)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(f,D,\\mathbb C\\cup\\{\\infty\\})\\land\\forall z\\in D\\;\\exists U\\subseteq D\\;\\exists g,h\\;\\left(z\\in U\\land\\mathrm{HolomorphicFunction}_S(g,U)\\land\\mathrm{HolomorphicFunction}_S(h,U)\\land\\exists w\\in U\\;(h(w)\\neq0)\\land\\forall w\\in U\\;\\left(h(w)\\neq0\\to f(w)=\\frac{g(w)}{h(w)}\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zeta\\text{-}meromorphic}\\vdash \\mathrm{MeromorphicOn}_S(f,D)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(f,D,\\mathbb C\\cup\\{\\infty\\})\\land\\forall z\\in D\\;\\exists U\\subseteq D\\;\\exists g,h\\;\\left(z\\in U\\land\\mathrm{HolomorphicFunction}_S(g,U)\\land\\mathrm{HolomorphicFunction}_S(h,U)\\land\\exists w\\in U\\;(h(w)\\neq0)\\land\\forall w\\in U\\;\\left(h(w)\\neq0\\to f(w)=\\frac{g(w)}{h(w)}\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zeta\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZetaFunction}_S(\\zeta)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MeromorphicOn}_S(\\zeta,\\mathbb C)\\land\\forall s\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Re}(s)&gt;1\\to\\zeta(s)=\\lim_{N\\to\\infty}\\sum_{n=1}^{N}n^{-s}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zeta\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZetaFunction}_S(\\zeta)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MeromorphicOn}_S(\\zeta,\\mathbb C)\\land\\forall s\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Re}(s)&gt;1\\to\\zeta(s)=\\lim_{N\\to\\infty}\\sum_{n=1}^{N}n^{-s}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This characterizes the Riemann zeta function as the meromorphic continuation of its Dirichlet series on the half-plane <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Re}(s)&gt;1\">\\(\\operatorname{Re}(s)&gt;1\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Meromorphicity is now defined locally as a quotient of holomorphic functions; the Dirichlet-series dependency did not in fact export any <code>MeromorphicOn</code> predicate.</li>\n<li>The simple pole at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>, residue <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>, Euler product, completed zeta function, and functional equation are theorem-level consequences or separate definitions.</li>\n<li>Pointwise convergence and analyticity are general notions and are not redefined inside this zeta atom.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Titchmarsh, The Theory of the Riemann Zeta-Function</li>\n<li>Iwaniec and Kowalski, Analytic Number Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-dirichlet-series","status":"resolved","id":"5d60e86f21ed502a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-dirichlet-series]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-holomorphic-function","status":"resolved","id":"d85f24c98c7d4149","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-holomorphic-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-holomorphic-function","status":"resolved","id":"d85f24c98c7d4149","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HolomorphicFunction}_S$ and $\\mathrm{Function}$ (see [[58-df-holomorphic-function]] and [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HolomorphicFunction}_S$ and $\\mathrm{Function}$ (see [[58-df-holomorphic-function]] and [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\zeta:\\mathbb C\\to\\mathbb C\\cup\\{\\infty\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HolomorphicFunction}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeromorphicOn}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZetaFunction}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zeta\\text{-}meromorphic}\\vdash \\mathrm{MeromorphicOn}_S(f,D)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Function}(f,D,\\mathbb C\\cup\\{\\infty\\})\\land\\forall z\\in D\\;\\exists U\\subseteq D\\;\\exists g,h\\;\\left(z\\in U\\land\\mathrm{HolomorphicFunction}_S(g,U)\\land\\mathrm{HolomorphicFunction}_S(h,U)\\land\\exists w\\in U\\;(h(w)\\neq0)\\land\\forall w\\in U\\;\\left(h(w)\\neq0\\to f(w)=\\frac{g(w)}{h(w)}\\right)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zeta\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZetaFunction}_S(\\zeta)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MeromorphicOn}_S(\\zeta,\\mathbb C)\\land\\forall s\\in\\mathbb C\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Re}(s)>1\\to\\zeta(s)=\\lim_{N\\to\\infty}\\sum_{n=1}^{N}n^{-s}\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Re}(s)>1","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false}],"bytes":2047,"backlinks":[{"id":"11e1272c45fe01cc","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bda18e5a40f416fb","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2fa80316020e129d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZetaFunction}_S\\subseteq V$ (Riemann zeta 谓词, see [[58-df-zeta-function]])"},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-28","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-zeta-function]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1404","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zeta-function.md|58-df-zeta-function]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["5d60e86f21ed502a","d85f24c98c7d4149","36d7463d215be751"]}